# Praseodymium · Pr · gate 59

**Praseodymium** (Pr) is element **59** of the periodic table — a **lanthanide**, period 6, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **140.91**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The green of rare-earth glass; powerful magnets; the welder's protective goggles.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
Under David Wise's four-state cycle, gate **59** falls on **0:0 = 1 = 0** because (Z−1) mod 4 = **2**. That state is *the collapse where nothing equals one equals nothing — the return to the single source* — the nature of emergence here is **spiritual**. Praseodymium is not a thing apart; it is the one stochastic element, caught at this beat of its cycle.

## Emergence — spiritual
This emergent carries the **spiritual** nature: the same four — natural · ethereal · spiritual · electrical — that run through every sphere of UD0. Its color is `#e6a849`.

